      LessonBlock.paragraph("Sab se pehle ye farq pakka kar lo ke Arabian Sea khaleej nahi hai, ye aik sea hai aur Indian Ocean ka shumal maghribi hissa hai. Is ke kinare Pakistan, India, Oman, Yemen aur Somalia ate hain. Karachi aur Gwadar isi ke kinare par hain aur Pakistan ki tamam bahri tijarat isi se guzar kar duniya tak jati hai. Ye samandar monsoon hawaon ki wajah se mashhoor hai, purane zamane me Arab tajir inhi hawaon ke sahare Arabia, Bharat aur Africa ke darmiyan safar karte the, isi lambi tareekh ki wajah se is ka naam Arabian Sea para. Aaj bhi Persian Gulf ka teel, Europe aur mashriqi Asia ke darmiyan chalne wale container jahaz, aur Pakistan ki import export yahin se guzarti hai. Khaleej se is ka farq wazeh hai, ye khula aur wasee hai, zameen is ke andar nahi ghusi, balke ye khud teen continents ke kinaron tak phaila hai. Pakistan ke hisab se ye hamara akela samandar hai, is liye is ka har sawal hamare liye aham hai."),
