    lon: 38.5,
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Africa aur Arabia ke darmiyan phasi hui lambi aur tang pani ki patti Red Sea hai. Is ke maghribi kinare par Egypt, Sudan, Eritrea aur Djibouti hain aur mashriqi kinare par Saudi Arabia aur Yemen. Is ke shumal me Suez Canal hai jo ise Mediterranean Sea se milati hai, aur janub me Bab el-Mandeb hai jo ise Gulf of Aden aur phir Indian Ocean se milati hai. Yani ye sea Europe aur Asia ke darmiyan sab se chhote samandari raste ka darmiyani hissa hai. Is ka pani duniya ke garam aur namkeen paniyon me ginna jata hai aur is ki coral reefs bohat mashhoor hain. Naam ke bare me kaha jata hai ke kinare ke surkh paharon ya pani me kabhi kabhi nazar ane wale surkh rang ki wajah se ye naam para. Tijarat ke hisab se duniya ke jahazon ka bohat bara hissa Suez se hota hua yahin se guzarta hai, is liye is raste ki bandish ka asar poori duniya ki tijarat par parta hai."),
