    lat: 36.0,
    lon: 18.0,
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ye wo samandar hai jo teen continents ke darmiyan phasa hua hai. Shimal me Europe, janub me Africa aur mashriq me Asia, aur is ke kinare Spain, France, Italy, Greece, Turkey, Syria, Lebanon, Egypt aur Libya jese mulk hain. Ye bahar ki duniya se sirf do jagah se jurta hai, maghrib me Strait of Gibraltar ke zariye Atlantic Ocean se, aur mashriq me insaan ki banayi hui Suez Canal ke zariye Red Sea se. Raqbe me ye takreeban pachis lakh square kilometre hai aur duniya ke bare seas me ginna jata hai. Purani duniya ki tareekh ka bara hissa isi ke kinaron par likha gaya, Greek aur Roman tehzeebein yahin phalein aur baad me Muslim duniya ka bara hissa bhi isi ke gird raha. Is ke andar Sicily, Cyprus aur Crete jese mashhoor jazire hain. Paper me ye teen continents wale point aur Gibraltar wale darwaze ke sath ata hai, ye dono baatein pakki kar lo."),
