    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Bharat ke mashriq aur Myanmar ke maghrib me waaqe Bay of Bengal duniya ki sab se bari bay hai, itni bari ke bohat se mashhoor seas is se chhote hain. Is ke kinare India, Bangladesh aur Myanmar hain aur janub ki taraf Sri Lanka ka jazira is ke munh par hai. Ganga aur Brahmaputra jese bare darya isi me girte hain aur Bangladesh ke kinare par un ka mashhoor delta banta hai jo duniya ka sab se bara delta hai. Ye bay apne samandari toofanon yani cyclones ki wajah se bhi badnaam hai jo taqreeban har saal kinare ke ilaaqon me tabahi late hain. Is ke andar Bharat ke Andaman aur Nicobar jazire hain. Pakistan ke hisab se ye hamare mashriqi samandari pados me hai aur monsoon ka nizam yahin se banta hua hamari taraf ata hai. Bay aur gulf ke farq me ye sab se achi misaal hai ke naam hamesha size se tay nahi hota, shakal aur tareekh se bhi hota hai."),
