    lon: -90.0,
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.paragraph("North America ke janub mashriq me zameen se ghiri hui ye bari khaleej hai jis ke kinare America, Mexico aur Cuba ka jazira hain. Mississippi, jo America ka sab se bara darya hai, isi khaleej me girta hai. Is ke teh me teel aur gas ke bare zakhair hain aur kinare par America ki bari refineries aur bandargahen hain, jin me Houston mashhoor hai. Ye khaleej apne sakht samandari toofanon yani hurricanes ki wajah se bhi khabron me rehti hai jo har saal kinare ke shehron ko nuqsan pohanchate hain. Garam current Gulf Stream yahin ke garam pani se paida hokar Florida ke paas se Atlantic ki taraf nikalti hai, jis ka zikr tum istilahaat wali file me parh chuke ho. Florida ki aabnaay aur Yucatan ke raste se ye khaleej Caribbean Sea aur Atlantic Ocean se jurti hai. Naqshay par America ke neeche bani hui ye bari jeb tumhe foran nazar ayegi."),
