    lon: 45.5,
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Arabia ke janub aur Africa ke mashriqi sing, jisay Horn of Africa kehte hain, ke darmiyan waaqe khaleej hai. Is ke shimal me Yemen hai aur janub me Somalia aur Djibouti. Bab el-Mandeb ke zariye ye Red Sea se jurti hai aur dusri taraf Arabian Sea me khulti hai, yani Suez se hokar Europe se Asia jane wala har jahaz yahan se lazmi guzarta hai. Chand saal pehle tak ye ilaqa Somalia ke samandari dakuon yani pirates ki wajah se duniya bhar ki khabron me raha, jahazon ko aghwa kiya jata tha, aur bohat se mulkon ki navies yahan gasht karti rahi hain. Aden ka sheher aur us ki purani bandargah Yemen ke janubi kinare par is khaleej ki pehchan hai. Tijarati raste ke hisab se ye chhoti si khaleej duniya ke aham tareen paniyon me hai, kyunke ye Red Sea wale raste ko khule samandar se jorti hai."),
