    lon: 115.0,
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pacific Ocean ka wo hissa hai jo China ke janub, Vietnam ke mashriq, Philippines ke maghrib aur Malaysia aur Indonesia ke shumal me phasa hua hai. Duniya ki samandari tijarat ka bohat bara hissa isi sea se guzarta hai, kyunke Malacca se ane wale jahaz yahin se hokar China, Japan aur Korea ki bandargahon tak jate hain. Is ke teh me teel aur gas ke zakhair ka andaza hai aur machhliyon ke bare zakhair bhi hain, is liye kinare ke tamam mulk is par apna haq jatate hain. Aaj kal ye sea khabron me is liye rehta hai ke is ke chhote jaziron aur paniyon par China aur aas paas ke mulkon, khaas taur par Philippines aur Vietnam, ke darmiyan ikhtilaf chal raha hai aur China yahan masnooi jazire bhi bana raha hai. Paper me ye sea tijarati raste aur is ikhtilaf dono hisab se ata hai. Naqshay par China ke neeche phaila hua ye neela hissa tumhe Malacca wali file ke sath jor kar yaad rahega."),
