      LessonBlock.paragraph("America ke janub mashriq me jaziron se ghira hua garam sea hai jo Atlantic Ocean ka hissa hai. Is ke shimal me Cuba, Jamaica aur Hispaniola jese bare jazire aur chhote jaziron ki lambi qataar hai jinhe mil kar West Indies kehte hain, aur janub me Venezuela aur Colombia ka sahel hai. Panama Canal ka mashriqi darwaza isi sea me khulta hai, is liye Atlantic se Pacific jane wale jahaz yahan se guzarte hain. Ye ilaqa apne hurricanes, khoobsurat sahilon aur purane zamane ke samandari dakuon ki kahani ki wajah se mashhoor hai. Cricket khelne wale West Indies ke mulk bhi yahi hain, aur un ka naam is sea ke kinare wale jaziron ki wajah se para hai. Paper me Caribbean aksar Panama Canal aur West Indies ke sath jor kar ata hai."),
