    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Asia aur North America ke darmiyan wo tang aabnaay hai jo Pacific Ocean ko Arctic Ocean se milati hai. Is ke maghrib me Russia ka Chukotka hai aur mashriq me America ka Alaska, aur tang tareen jagah par dono kinaron ke darmiyan faasla takreeban bayasi kilometre hai. Is ke darmiyan do chhote jazire hain jinhe Diomede kehte hain, aik Russia ka hai aur dusra America ka, aur un ke darmiyan se waqt ki woh lakeer guzarti hai jisay International Date Line kehte hain, yani aik jazire par aaj hai to dusre par kal. Mahireen ke khayal me barf ke zamane me jab samandar ki satah neechi thi to yahin aik zameeni pul tha jisay paar karke pehle insaan Asia se America pohunche the. Aaj ye ilaqa sakht sardi aur barf ki wajah se tijarat me kam istemal hota hai, lekin do azeem continents ko sab se qareeb se jodne wali yehi jagah hai."),
