      LessonBlock.paragraph("Mediterranean Sea ko Atlantic Ocean se milane wali ye aabnaay Europe aur Africa ke darmiyan hai. Shimal me Spain hai aur janub me Morocco, aur tang tareen jagah par dono kinaron ke darmiyan faasla sirf takreeban terah kilometre hai, itna kam ke saaf din me khade hokar dusra kinara nazar ajata hai. Jo jahaz Atlantic se Mediterranean me jayega wo yahin se guzre ga, aur Mediterranean ke tamam mulkon ke liye ye maghrib ki taraf akela qudrati darwaza hai. Tareekh me 711 esvi me Tariq bin Ziyad ne yehi aabnaay paar karke Spain me qadam rakha tha, aur Gibraltar ka naam bhi Jabal Tariq, yani Tariq ke pahar, se bana hai. Ye naam wali baat paper me bohat ati hai, isay pakka kar lo. Naqshay par Spain ke neeche aur Morocco ke upar bani ye tang gali Mediterranean ka darwaza hai."),
