      LessonBlock.paragraph("Red Sea ko Gulf of Aden se milane wali ye tang aabnaay Arabia aur Africa ke darmiyan hai. Aik taraf Yemen hai aur dusri taraf Djibouti aur Eritrea. Is ke naam ka matlab aansuon ka darwaza hai, kaha jata hai ke purane zamane me yahan ke khatarnaak patharon aur tez lehron ki wajah se bohat se jahaz doobte the, is liye ye naam para. Suez Canal se guzar kar Europe aur Asia ke darmiyan chalne wala har jahaz yahan se lazmi guzarta hai, is liye ye duniya ki chand aham tareen guzargahon me ginni jati hai. Is ke darmiyan Perim ka jazira ise do raston me bant deta hai. Iski ahmiyat ka andaza is se lagao ke agar ye rasta band ho jaye to jahazon ko poora Africa ghoom kar jana parega, jo waqt aur kharche dono ko bohat barha deta hai. Naqshay par Red Sea ke janubi siray par bani ye tang jagah is poore raste ki dusri chaabi hai, pehli chaabi Suez hai."),
