      LessonBlock.paragraph("England aur France ke darmiyan waaqe ye channel Atlantic Ocean ko North Sea se milati hai. Is ke sab se tang hisse ko Strait of Dover kehte hain jahan dono kinaron ke darmiyan faasla sirf takreeban chontees kilometre hai. Duniya ke masroof tareen jahazrani raston me ye shamil hai, rozana sainkadon jahaz yahan se guzarte hain aur dono kinaron ke darmiyan ferry ka silsila bhi chalta hai. Sann 1994 me is ke neeche Channel Tunnel bani jo England ko France se train ke zariye milati hai, aur is se pehle England hamesha aik jazire ki tarah alag raha tha. Tareekh me is channel ne England ko bohat se bare hamlo se bachaya, kyunke hamla awar ko pehle ye pani paar karna parta tha aur mausam aksar us ke khilaf hota tha. Paper me ye channel apni tunnel aur masroof raste ki wajah se ata hai."),
