const List<GeoTopic> worldTopics = <GeoTopic>[
  GeoTopic(
    id: "countries",
    title: "Mashhoor Mulk — Darul Hukumat aur Currency",
    subtitle: "Paper ke pasandeeda mulk, un ke darul hukumat aur sikke",
    portion: "world",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye hissa kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("One paper me har saal chand sawal mulkon par ate hain. Falan mulk ka darul hukumat kya hai, falan mulk ki currency kya hai, sab se bara mulk konsa hai. Ye sawal ratne se nahi, jor banane se yaad hote hain. Har mulk ko us ki aik pehchan ke sath bandh lo to darul hukumat aur currency khud yaad ane lagte hain. Aur aik khaas baat pehle se samajh lo, paper hamesha un mulkon me phansata hai jahan sab se mashhoor sheher hi darul hukumat nahi hota. Australia ka mashhoor sheher Sydney hai lekin darul hukumat Canberra hai. Turkey ka mashhoor sheher Istanbul hai lekin darul hukumat Ankara hai. Jahan jahan ye jaal hai, main wahan ruk kar tumhe wazeh karunga. Kul mila kar hum takreeban 30 mulk parhenge, wahi jo paper me ghumte rehte hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Asia ke mulk"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehle apna continent. Asia ke wo mulk jo paper me sab se zyada ate hain, aik aik karke."),
      LessonBlock.heading("China"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("China ka darul hukumat Beijing hai aur currency Yuan hai, jisay Renminbi bhi kehte hain. China raqbe me duniya ke bare mulkon me hai aur abadi me ab India ke baad doosre number par hai. Is ki pehchan Great Wall of China hai, duniya ki sab se lambi deewar, jo hazaron kilometre phaili hai. China ka sab se lamba darya Yangtze hai jis ka zikr tum pichhle hisse me parh chuke ho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("India"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("India ka darul hukumat New Delhi hai aur currency Indian Rupee hai. Yahan pehla jaal samajh lo, darul hukumat Delhi nahi, New Delhi hai, ye bareek farq paper me ata hai. India ab abadi me duniya ka sab se pehla mulk ban chuka hai. Agra me waaqe Taj Mahal is ki duniya bhar me pehchan hai. Rupee ka lafz Pakistan se mila kar confuse mat hona, aage ye baat khulegi ke Rupee kai mulkon ki currency ka naam hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Japan"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Japan ka darul hukumat Tokyo hai aur currency Yen hai. Japan Asia ke mashriq me jaziron ka mulk hai. Isay Land of the Rising Sun, yani ugte suraj ki sarzameen, kaha jata hai, kyunke Asia me suraj sab se pehle yahin nazar ata hai. Japan ke apne lafz Nihon ka matlab bhi suraj ka sar chashma hai. Mount Fuji yahan ki mashhoor choti hai. Suraj wala sawal aye to jawab Japan hai, pakka kar lo."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Saudi Arabia"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Saudi Arabia ka darul hukumat Riyadh hai aur currency Saudi Riyal hai. Is mulk ki pehchan do cheezain hain, Makkah aur Madinah ke muqaddas sheher, aur duniya ke bare teel ke zakhair. Currency par khaas tawajjo do, Riyal ke hawalay se aage Iran ke Rial se is ka farq ayega, yahi paper ka jaal hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Iran"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Iran ka darul hukumat Tehran hai aur currency Iranian Rial hai. Ab farq saaf sun lo. Saudi ki currency Riyal hai aur Iran ki Rial, dono ke bolne me halka sa farq hai lekin paper me yehi farq number deta hai. Aam bol chal me Iran me das Rial ko aik Toman bhi kaha jata hai, ye maloomat bhi kabhi kaam ati hai. Iran Pakistan ka maghribi parosi hai, ye baat Pak Studies se jurti hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("United Arab Emirates"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("UAE ka darul hukumat Abu Dhabi hai aur currency Dirham hai. Yahan is hisse ka mashhoor jaal hai. Duniya bhar me mashhoor sheher Dubai hai, Burj Khalifa bhi Dubai me hai, lekin darul hukumat Dubai nahi, Abu Dhabi hai. Ye sawal paper me itni dafa aya hai ke isay alag se zehen me nashaan laga kar rakho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Bangladesh"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Bangladesh ka darul hukumat Dhaka hai aur currency Taka hai. Isay daryaaon ka mulk kaha jata hai kyunke Ganga aur Brahmaputra ke delta par waaqe hai, aur ye delta duniya ka sab se bara delta hai. 1971 se pehle ye Pakistan ka mashriqi hissa tha, ye baat Pak Studies ke liye khaas hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Sri Lanka"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Sri Lanka ka darul hukumat Sri Jayawardenepura Kotte hai aur currency Sri Lankan Rupee hai. Yahan aik imandari wali baat sun lo. Purani kitabon me Sri Lanka ka darul hukumat Colombo likha milta hai. Asal soorat ye hai ke Sri Jayawardenepura Kotte qanoon saaz darul hukumat hai aur Colombo purana aur sab se bara sheher hai jahan bohat se sarkari dafatir ab bhi hain. Nayi kitabon me Kotte ata hai, paper me jo option mile usi hisab se jawab dena. Sri Lanka Indian Ocean me jazira mulk hai aur isay Hind ka moti bhi kaha jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Nepal"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Nepal ka darul hukumat Kathmandu hai aur currency Nepalese Rupee hai. Nepal ki pehchan Everest hai, duniya ki sab se unchi choti isi mulk me hai, is liye Nepal ko duniya ki chhat bhi kaha jata hai. Ye Pakistan ki tarah landlocked nahi lekin samandar se ghira bhi nahi, paharon wala mulk hai. Rupee yahan teesri dafa aya, Pakistan, India aur Nepal teeno ki currency ka naam Rupee hai, hawalay se mulk pehchanna hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Afghanistan"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Afghanistan ka darul hukumat Kabul hai aur currency Afghani hai. Ye Pakistan ka shimal maghribi parosi hai aur Durand Line wali sarhad isi ke sath hai, jis ki tafseel tum Pakistan wale hisse me parh chuke ho. Afghanistan landlocked mulk hai, yani is ke kisi taraf samandar nahi. Currency ka naam Afghani hai, admi ko bhi Afghan kehte hain aur sikke ko bhi Afghani, ye chhota sa point paper me ata hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Indonesia"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Indonesia ka darul hukumat Jakarta hai aur currency Rupiah hai. Pichhle hisse me tum parh chuke ho ke ye duniya ka sab se bara archipelago mulk hai, 17 hazar se zyada jazire. Is ki doosri bari pehchan ye hai ke ye duniya ka sab se zyada Muslim abadi wala mulk hai. Java is ka sab se mashhoor aur sab se zyada abadi wala jazira hai, aur Jakarta isi par hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Malaysia"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Malaysia ka darul hukumat Kuala Lumpur hai aur currency Ringgit hai. Aik chhoti si maloomat ye hai ke Malaysia ka intizami darul hukumat Putrajaya hai jahan bohat si wizaratain hain, lekin rasmi darul hukumat Kuala Lumpur hi hai. Malacca wali mashhoor guzargah isi mulk ke saahil ke sath hai, jis ka zikr tum pichhle hisse me parh chuke ho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Thailand"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Thailand ka darul hukumat Bangkok hai aur currency Baht hai. Thailand ki khaas baat jo paper me ati hai ye hai ke ye South East Asia ka wo mulk hai jo kabhi kisi European taqat ki colony nahi bana. Is ke purane naam Siam se bhi sawal banta hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("South Korea"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("South Korea ka darul hukumat Seoul hai aur currency Won hai. Korea do mulkon me banta hai, South Korea aur North Korea, North Korea ka darul hukumat Pyongyang hai. Dono ko mila kar confuse hona aam ghalti hai. Paper me Korea ka sawal aye to pehle dekho ke shimal poocha hai ya janub."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Do bar-e-azamon par phailay mulk"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab teen mulk aisay parho jo aik hi continent me nahi aate. Ye teen paper ke sab se pasandeeda hain kyunke in par do sawal aik sath bante hain, darul hukumat ka aur do continents wala."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Turkey"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Turkey ka darul hukumat Ankara hai aur currency Turkish Lira hai. Sab se pehle jaal saaf kar lo, Istanbul Turkey ka sab se bara aur sab se mashhoor sheher hai lekin darul hukumat nahi, darul hukumat Ankara hai. Turkey do continents par phaila hai, is ka chhota hissa Europe me aur bara hissa Asia me hai, aur Istanbul sheher khud Bosphorus ke dono kinaron par honay ki wajah se dono continents me ata hai. Do continents wala sawal aye to pehla naam Turkey ka zehen me ana chahiye."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Russia"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Russia ka darul hukumat Moscow hai aur currency Ruble hai. Russia raqbe me duniya ka sab se bara mulk hai, taqreeban 17.1 million square kilometre, yani duniya ki zameen ka aathwan hissa ke qareeb akela Russia hai. Ye bhi do continents ka mulk hai, Ural paharon ke maghrib wala hissa Europe me aur mashriq wala hissa Asia me, jahan Siberia ka mashhoor ilaaqa hai. Lake Baikal bhi isi mulk me hai. Is ke size ka andaza is se lagao ke is me gyarah time zones hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Egypt"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Egypt ka darul hukumat Cairo hai aur currency Egyptian Pound hai. Egypt bhi do continents ka mulk hai, is ka bara hissa Africa me hai aur Sinai ka hissa Asia me, aur Suez Canal in dono ke darmiyan se guzarti hai. Nile darya aur qadeem pyramids is ki duniya bhar me pehchan hain. Pound yahan phir aya, England wale Pound se isay alag pehchanna, ye Egyptian Pound hai. Teen do-continent wale mulk aik line me bandh lo, Turkey, Russia, Egypt."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Europe ke mulk"),
      LessonBlock.heading("United Kingdom"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("UK ka darul hukumat London hai aur currency Pound Sterling hai. London River Thames ke kinare waaqe hai. UK chaar mulkon ka majmooa hai, England, Scotland, Wales aur Northern Ireland, ye baat bhi GK me ati hai. England aur UK ko aik samajhna aam ghalti hai, England UK ka aik hissa hai, pura mulk nahi."),
      LessonBlock.heading("France"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("France ka darul hukumat Paris hai aur currency Euro hai. Paris me waaqe Eiffel Tower duniya ki mashhoor tareen imaraton me hai. France Europe ke bare mulkon me hai aur is ka purana sikka Franc tha, ab Euro chalta hai, purani kitabon wala Franc dekh kar confuse mat hona."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Germany"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Germany ka darul hukumat Berlin hai aur currency Euro hai. Germany ko Europe ki sab se bari economy mana jata hai. Doosri Aalmai Jang ke baad Germany do mulkon me bant gaya tha, East aur West Germany, aur 1990 me dono phir aik ho gaye, Berlin Wall ka girna isi kahani ka mashhoor waqia hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Italy"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Italy ka darul hukumat Rome hai aur currency Euro hai. Rome qadeem Roman Empire ka markaz tha, aur wahan ka Colosseum, purana stadium, duniya bhar me mashhoor hai. Italy naqshay par boot, yani jootay, ki shakal ka nazar ata hai, ye pehchan bhi sawal me kaam ati hai. Duniya ka sab se chhota mulk Vatican City Rome ke andar hi waaqe hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Spain"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Spain ka darul hukumat Madrid hai aur currency Euro hai. Spain Europe ke janub maghrib me hai aur Gibraltar wali mashhoor guzargah is ke bilkul janub me hai, jis ka zikr tum pichhle hisse me parh chuke ho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Greece"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Greece ka darul hukumat Athens hai aur currency Euro hai. Greece ko jamhooriyat ki janam jagah mana jata hai, aur Olympic Games bhi yahin se shuru hue. Europe ke in mulkon me aik mushtarka baat dekh lo, France, Germany, Italy, Spain aur Greece sab ki currency Euro hai. Euro walon ko aik group me yaad kar lo to aadha kaam ho jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("America ke mulk"),
      LessonBlock.heading("USA"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("USA ka darul hukumat Washington DC hai aur currency Dollar hai. Yahan bhi mashhoor jaal hai, New York USA ka sab se mashhoor sheher hai lekin darul hukumat nahi. Darul hukumat Washington DC hai, aur naam ke sath laga DC District of Columbia ka matlab hai, ye kisi riyasat ka hissa nahi, alag zila hai. USA pachaas riyaston ka mulk hai aur economy ke hisab se duniya ke sab se aage mulkon me hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Canada"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Canada ka darul hukumat Ottawa hai aur currency Canadian Dollar hai. Jaal yahan bhi wahi hai, Toronto sab se bara sheher hai lekin darul hukumat Ottawa hai. Canada raqbe me Russia ke baad duniya ka doosra bara mulk hai. Dollar yahan phir aya, ye American Dollar se alag Canadian Dollar hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Brazil"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Brazil ka darul hukumat Brasilia hai aur currency Real hai. Yahan jaal do hain. Aik ye ke Rio de Janeiro mashhoor sheher hai aur aik zamane me darul hukumat bhi tha, lekin ab darul hukumat Brasilia hai jo khaas is maqsad ke liye banaya gaya sheher hai. Dusra ye ke South America ke baqi mulk Spanish bolte hain lekin Brazil me Portuguese boli jati hai. Brazil South America ka sab se bara mulk hai aur Amazon ka jangal isi me hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Argentina"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Argentina ka darul hukumat Buenos Aires hai aur currency Peso hai. South America ki sab se unchi choti Aconcagua isi mulk me hai, jis ka zikr Andes wale hisse me aya tha. Peso ka naam Spain ke asar se kai mulkon me milta hai, is liye mulk ka naam sath pehchanna zaroori hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Africa ka aik aur aham mulk"),
      LessonBlock.heading("Nigeria"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Nigeria ka darul hukumat Abuja hai aur currency Naira hai. Yahan bhi mashhoor sheher Lagos hai lekin darul hukumat Abuja hai, bilkul wahi purana jaal. Nigeria Africa ka sab se zyada abadi wala mulk hai, is liye is ka naam abadi wale sawalon me ata hai. Aur Egypt to tum upar parh hi chuke ho, Africa ke do naam pakke kar lo, Egypt aur Nigeria."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Oceania ke mulk"),
      LessonBlock.heading("Australia"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Australia ka darul hukumat Canberra hai aur currency Australian Dollar hai. Is pure hisse ka sab se mashhoor jaal yahi hai. Sydney Australia ka sab se mashhoor sheher hai, Opera House bhi wahin hai, lekin darul hukumat Sydney nahi, Canberra hai. Ye sawal itni dafa paper me aya hai ke is par alag se nashaan laga lo. Australia khud sab se chhota continent bhi hai aur mulk bhi, ye doosri pehchan bhi yaad rakho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("New Zealand"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("New Zealand ka darul hukumat Wellington hai aur currency New Zealand Dollar hai. Ye Australia ke janub mashriq me jaziron ka mulk hai. Iski pehchan kiwi parinda hai jo yahin milta hai. Dollar yahan teesri surat me aya, American, Canadian, Australian aur New Zealand, chaar mulkon ki currency ka naam Dollar hai lekin har aik apni alag hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Currency wale jaal, aik nazar me"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab aakhir me wo ghaltiyan bandh lo jo paper me sab se zyada hoti hain. Pehli, Dollar sirf USA ka nahi, Canada, Australia aur New Zealand ka bhi hai. Dusri, Rupee sirf Pakistan ka nahi, India, Nepal aur Sri Lanka ka bhi hai. Teesri, Saudi ke Riyal aur Iran ke Rial me confuse hona, dono alag mulk, alag sikke. Chauthi, Pound UK ka bhi hai aur Egypt ka bhi. Aur paanchvi, Europe ke zyada tar mashhoor mulkon ki currency aik hi hai, Euro. Agar ye paanch baatein saaf hon to currency wala sawal tumhara kabhi ghalat nahi hoga."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Aakhir me poora khaka zehen me bandh lo"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Har mulk ko us ki pehchan ke sath jor kar yaad karo. Mashhoor sheher wala jaal Canberra, Ankara, Abu Dhabi, Ottawa, Brasilia aur Abuja me hai, in chhe ko aik sath rat lo ke ye wo darul hukumat hain jo mashhoor shehron ke peeche chhupe hain. Do continents wale teen hain, Turkey, Russia aur Egypt. Sab se bara mulk Russia hai. Euro walon ka group alag hai, Dollar walon ka group alag. Jab mulk ka naam dekh kar us ki pehchan wali tasveer zehen me ane lagay to samajh lo ye hissa pakka ho gaya, aur paper me ye number tum se koi nahi cheen sakta."),
    ],
  ),
  GeoTopic(
    id: "world-terms",
    title: "Naqshay ki Istilahaat — Pani aur Zameen ki Shaklain",
    subtitle: "Har shakal ka asaan matlab, naqshay par pehchan, duniya aur Pakistan ki misaal, aur paper wali baat",
    portion: "world",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye topic kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dekho, duniya ke naqshay par pani aur zameen ne ajeeb ajeeb shaklain bana rakhi hain. Kahin pani zameen ke andar ghusa hua hai, kahin zameen pani me nok banaye khari hai, kahin do samandar aik tang gali se juray hain. One paper ka sawal inhi shaklon par banta hai. Sawal poochta hai ke khaleej kise kehte hain, aabnaay aur channel me kya farq hai, falana jagah peninsula hai ya cape. Student ko jagah ka naam yaad hota hai lekin shakal ki pehchan nahi hoti, aur wahi number kat jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is liye har shakal ko chaar hisso me parho ge. Pehle asaan alfaaz me matlab, jese ustad class me samjhata hai. Phir ye ke naqshay par us shakal ko dekh kar kesay pehchano ge, kyunke paper me pehchan hi asal imtihan hai. Phir duniya ki aik misaal aur jahan mumkin ho Pakistan ki misaal, taake shakal hawa me na rahe. Aur aakhir me wo baat jo paper me sawal banti hai. Bas yehi tartib zehen me bitha lo, phir poora naqsha tum se baatein karega."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Gulf (Khaleej)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Samandar ka wo bara hissa jo zameen ke andar door tak ghusa hua ho aur jis ka munh baqi samandar ki nisbat tang ho, use gulf yani khaleej kehte hain. Asaan tasveer ye hai ke jese pani ne zameen ke andar aik bari jeb bana li ho, jeb andar se chauri aur us ka munh tang."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Naqshay par pehchan ye hai. Pani ki aik bari aur gehri jeb zameen ke andar ghusi hui nazar ayegi. Teen taraf zameen hogi aur sirf aik taraf tang sa rasta khule samandar ki taraf khulega. Kinare andar ki taraf narm ghulay hue honge, nokile nahi honge."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Duniya ki misaal ye hai. Persian Gulf, jisay Khaleej-e-Faris kehte hain, Iran aur Arabia ke darmiyan zameen me ghusi hui hai. Gulf of Mexico America ke janub me hai. Pakistan ki misaal ye hai ke Gwadar ke qareeb bhi chhoti khaleej numa shaklain banti hain jinhe wahan khor kaha jata hai, lekin asal bari khaleej hamare pados me Persian Gulf hi hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Khaleejain aksar teel aur tijarat ke sath jor kar ati hain, khaas taur par Persian Gulf. Aur ye bhi yaad rakho ke khaleej ka munh tang hota hai, yehi us ki sab se wazeh pehchan hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Bay (Khaari)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Bay bhi samandar ka zameen ke andar ghusa hua hissa hai, lekin gulf se chhota hota hai aur us ka munh khula hota hai. Asaan alfaaz me ye sahil ke andar bana hua aik khula sa kataav hai, jese kinare ne halka sa andar ki taraf jhukao liya ho."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Naqshay par pehchan ye hai. Sahil me aik gol sa kataav nazar ayega, lekin ye kataav zameen ke andar zyada door tak nahi gaya hoga aur us ka darwaza chaura hoga. Zameen use poori tarah gher nahi rahi hogi, bas aik taraf se halka sa ghera hoga. Gulf wali jeb yahan nahi banti."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Duniya ki misaal ye hai. Bay of Bengal Bharat ke mashriq me hai aur ye duniya ki sab se bari bay hai, itni bari ke bohat se seas is se chhote hain. Pakistan ki misaal Karachi ke maghrib me Sonmiani Bay hai, jo aik khuli si khaari hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Bay of Bengal ko duniya ki sab se bari bay ke tor par pakka kar lo. Aur ye zehen me rakho ke naamon ka faisla hamesha size se nahi hota, tareekhi wajah bhi hoti hai, is liye paper me jo naam mashhoor hai wahi jawab hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Strait (Aabnaay)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Do bare paniyon ko milane wali tang pani ki patti, jis ke dono taraf zameen ho, use strait yani aabnaay kehte hain. Aabnaay asal me do samandaron ke darmiyan wala tang darwaza hai, aur darwaze ki tarah hi is ki ahmiyat hoti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Naqshay par pehchan ye hai. Do bare neelay hisse aik tang si gali se juray hue nazar ayenge, aur gali ke dono taraf zameen hogi. Tasveer yun banao ke do bare kamron ke darmiyan aik tang darwaza hai, jo guzre ga yahin se guzre ga."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Duniya ki misaal ye hai. Strait of Hormuz Persian Gulf ko Gulf of Oman aur phir khule Arabian Sea se milati hai. Strait of Gibraltar Mediterranean Sea ko Atlantic Ocean se milati hai. Pakistan se is ka taluq yun hai ke hamari bandargahon se nikalne wala har jahaz mashriq ya maghrib jate hue kisi na kisi aabnaay se lazmi guzarta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Aabnaay hamesha jora bana kar ati hai. Konsi aabnaay kin do paniyon ko milati hai, aur kin mulkon ke darmiyan hai. Ye jore pakke kar lo, kyunke seedha sawal yahi banta hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Channel"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Channel bhi do paniyon ko milane wala pani ka rasta hai, lekin strait se zyada khula, chaura aur lamba hota hai. Kaam wahi darwaze wala hai, farq bas tangi ka hai. Strait tang gali hai, channel chaura rasta."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Naqshay par pehchan ye hai. Do zameenon ke darmiyan pani ki chauri si patti door tak jati nazar ayegi. Ye tang gali nahi lagegi, balke khula beh raha pani lagega jis me jahaz asani se dono simton me chal sakte hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Duniya ki misaal ye hai. English Channel England aur France ke darmiyan hai aur Atlantic ko North Sea se milati hai. Mozambique Channel Africa aur Madagascar jazire ke darmiyan hai. Pakistan ke sahil ke sath koi mashhoor channel nahi, lekin Karachi ke qareeb Manora Channel bandargah ke andar jahazon ka rasta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. English Channel ko us ke neeche bani Channel Tunnel ke sath yaad rakho jo England ko France se milati hai. Aur farq wala sawal aye to jawab yehi hai, channel strait se chaura hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Peninsula (Jazira-numa)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Zameen ka wo hissa jis ke teen taraf pani ho aur sirf aik taraf wo bari zameen se juda ho, use peninsula yani jazira-numa kehte hain. Asaan lafzon me ye aadha jazira hai, poori tarah kata hua nahi, peeche se zameen ke sath jurra hua hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Naqshay par pehchan ye hai. Zameen ki aik bari nok ya zabaan pani ki taraf nikli hui nazar ayegi. Teen taraf neela pani hoga aur peeche ki taraf zameen ka bara hissa. Jazire se farq ye hai ke jazira chaaron taraf se kata hota hai, peninsula aik taraf se jurra hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Duniya ki misaal ye hai. Arabia duniya ka sab se bara peninsula hai, is ke gird Persian Gulf, Red Sea aur Arabian Sea hain. Bharat bhi aik bara peninsula hai. Pakistan ki misaal bohat khoobsurat hai, Gwadar aik hammer yani hathori jaisi shakal wale peninsula par basta hai jis ke gird gehra pani hai, aur yehi shakal usay bari bandargah ke liye behtareen banati hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Arabia ko duniya ka sab se bara peninsula pakka kar lo. Korea aur Florida bhi mashhoor peninsula hain, aur Bharat ko bhi aksar peninsula mulk kaha jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Isthmus"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Do bari zameenon ko milane wali tang zameeni patti, jis ke dono taraf pani ho, use isthmus kehte hain. Ye aabnaay ka bilkul ulta hai. Wahan pani ki tang patti zameenon ko alag karti thi, yahan zameen ki tang patti do zameenon ko milati hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Naqshay par pehchan ye hai. Do bare zameeni hisse aik tang si gardan se juray hue nazar ayenge, aur gardan ke dono taraf pani hoga. Jese do bare kamre aik tang raahdari se juray hon."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Duniya ki misaal ye hai. Panama ka isthmus North America aur South America ko milata hai, aur Panama Canal isi tang jagah ko kaat kar bani hai. Egypt me Suez wala isthmus Africa aur Asia ko milata hai, aur Suez Canal bhi yahin kati hai. Pakistan me aisi koi mashhoor isthmus nahi, hamari zameen wasee hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Jahan isthmus hoga wahan aksar canal hogi, kyunke tang zameen ko kaatna sab se asaan hota hai aur do samandaron ka faasla sab se kam ho jata hai. Panama aur Suez ka jora isthmus ke sath hi yaad rakho."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Cape (Ras)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Zameen ki wo nokili nok jo samandar ke andar ghusi hui ho, use cape kehte hain, Urdu aur Arabi me isay ras kehte hain. Ras zameen ka pani ki taraf barha hua kona hai, peninsula se bohat chhota."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Naqshay par pehchan ye hai. Sahil ki lakeer se aik nokili nok pani me nikli hui nazar ayegi. Ye peninsula wali bari zabaan nahi hogi, bas aik tez kona hoga jahan sahil achanak simt badalta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Duniya ki misaal ye hai. Cape of Good Hope Africa ke janubi konay par hai, 1498 me Vasco da Gama yehi rasta pakar kar Bharat pohuncha tha. Pakistan ki misaal Karachi ke qareeb Ras Muari hai jisay Cape Monze bhi kehte hain, aur Makran ke sahil par Ras Jaddi bhi mashhoor hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Cape of Good Hope tareekhi samandari raste ki wajah se ata hai. Aur Cape Horn South America ke janubi siray par hai, jahan do oceans milte hain aur mausam sakht rehta hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Delta"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Jahan darya samandar me girne se pehle sust ho jata hai, apne sath layi hui mitti aur ret wahan bicha deta hai aur kai chhoti shakho me bant kar samandar me milta hai, us zameen ko delta kehte hain. Darya yahan aik nahi rehta, phail jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Naqshay par pehchan ye hai. Darya ke munh par aik takon yani triangle ya pankhe jaisi shakal nazar ayegi, aur us ke andar chhoti chhoti lakeerain shakho ki surat me phaili hongi. Is ka naam hi Greek harf Delta ki takon wali shakal se para hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Duniya ki misaal ye hai. Nile Delta Egypt me hai jahan Nile Mediterranean me girta hai, aur Ganga ka delta Bangladesh me duniya ka sab se bara delta hai. Pakistan ki misaal Indus Delta hai jo Thatta aur Keti Bandar ke qareeb Arabian Sea me banta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Delta hamesha darya ke aakhri siray par hota hai aur apni zarkhez mitti ki wajah se mashhoor hota hai. Sawal ata hai ke falana darya ka delta kahan hai, jawab us ke samandar wale siray par hoga."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Estuary"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Estuary delta ki ulti shakal hai. Yahan darya shakho me nahi bantta, balke us ka munh aik chauri keertay yani funnel ki surat me khula rehta hai, jahan samandar ka jowar bhata andar tak ata hai aur mitti ko jama nahi honay deta. Pani yahan darya aur samandar ka mila jula hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Naqshay par pehchan ye hai. Darya ka munh andar ki taraf tang aur samandar ki taraf jate hue chaura phaila hua nazar ayega. Pankha nahi hoga, shakhein nahi hongi, bas aik khuli hui keerta numa khaari hogi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Duniya ki misaal ye hai. England ki Thames aur America ki Hudson ke munh mashhoor estuary hain, aur in par bari bandargahen bani hain kyunke gehra pani andar tak ajata hai. Pakistan ki misaal se farq samjho, Indus ne estuary nahi banaya, delta banaya hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Paper delta aur estuary ko aamne saamne rakh kar phansata hai. Darya bant kar phailay to delta, munh keertay ki tarah khula ho aur jowar andar aye to estuary. Bas ye aik line ka farq pakka kar lo."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Lagoon"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Sahil ke sath wo uthla yani kam gehra thehra hua pani jo ret ki patti, patharon ya coral ki deewar ki wajah se khule samandar se alag ho gaya ho, use lagoon kehte hain. Ye samandar se bilkul kata nahi hota, kisi tang raste se us se jurra rehta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Naqshay par pehchan ye hai. Sahil ke bilkul sath aik lambi patli jheel si nazar ayegi, lekin gaur karo to wo samandar se aik patli zameeni ya ret ki patti se alag hogi aur kahin se us me samandar ka pani araha hoga."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Duniya ki misaal ye hai. Maldives ke gole jaziron, jinhe atoll kehte hain, ke darmiyan lagoon bante hain aur un ka pani saaf aur uthla hota hai. Pakistan ki misaal Balochistan ke sahil par Miani Hor hai, jo Sonmiani ke qareeb aik mashhoor lagoon hai aur wahan mangrove ke jangal hain. Kalmat Hor bhi isi tarah ki lagoon hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Lagoon ko jheel se alag pehchano. Jheel chaaron taraf zameen se band hoti hai, lagoon samandar ke sath jurri hoti hai aur us ke aur samandar ke darmiyan bas aik patli patti hoti hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Ocean aur Sea ka farq"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab wo farq jo paper ka sab se pasandeeda sawal hai, ocean aur sea ka farq. Ise alag se aur tafseel se samjho, kyunke aadhe students yahin ulajhte hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ocean duniya ke pani ke wo azeem zakhair hain jo continents ke darmiyan phailay hain. Kul paanch ocean hain, Pacific, Atlantic, Indian, Southern aur Arctic. Zameen ki satah ka takreeban ikhattar feesad hissa pani hai aur us ka sab se bara hissa yahi oceans hain. Ocean ki pehchan teen hai. Ye bohat wasee hota hai, ye bohat gehra hota hai, aur zameen use band nahi karti, balke continents us ke kinaron par khade hote hain. Ocean khula hota hai, us ka apna koi band kinara nahi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Sea ocean ke muqable me chhota hota hai. Ye asal me kisi ocean ka hi wo hissa hai jo zameen ke kinare ki taraf phasa hua ho ya zameen ke andar ghusa hua ho. Sea aksar teen taraf se ya zyada taraf se zameen se ghira hota hai, ocean se kam gehra hota hai, aur us ka pani aur mausam qareebi zameen se zyada mutaassir hota hai. Sab se aham baat ye hai ke har mashhoor sea asal me kisi na kisi ocean ka hissa hai. Arabian Sea Indian Ocean ka hissa hai. Mediterranean Sea Strait of Gibraltar ke zariye Atlantic Ocean se jurta hai. Caribbean Sea bhi Atlantic ka hissa hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Naqshay par pehchan ye hai. Ocean khula aur wasee neela phaila hoga jis ka koi band kinara nazar nahi ayega. Sea zameen ke andar ghusa hua ya kinare se laga hua nisbatan chhota neela hissa hoga jis ke gird zameen ka ghera saaf dikhega."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Farq teen nuqton me band kar lo. Size me ocean bara, gehrai me ocean gehra, aur sea zameen se ghira hota hai jabke ocean nahi. Aur tadaad bhi yaad rakho, ocean kul paanch hain, seas darjanon hain. Ye chaar baatein hi sawal ke chaar options banti hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Sea aur Lake ka farq, Caspian wala jaal"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab is se bhi bare jaal ki baat. Kuch paniyon ke naam ke sath Sea laga hua hai lekin wo asal me sea hain hi nahi, wo jheelein hain. Pehle farq samajh lo. Sea asal me samandar ka hissa hoti hai aur kisi na kisi surat ocean se jurti hai, chahe tang aabnaay se hi sahi. Lake chaaron taraf zameen se ghiri hoti hai aur ocean se us ka koi rabta nahi hota, us me darya girte hain lekin wo kahin bahar nahi nikalti ya nikalti bhi hai to kisi darya ki surat me."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Duniya ki misaal ye hai. Caspian Sea Russia, Iran aur darmiyani Asia ke mulkon ke darmiyan hai, lekin ye asal me duniya ki sab se bari jheel hai, kyunke ye har taraf zameen se ghiri hai aur kisi ocean se nahi milti. Isi tarah Dead Sea aur Aral Sea bhi naam ke sea hain, asal me jheelein hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Naqshay par pehchan ye hai. Pani ko dekho, agar wo har taraf zameen se band hai aur us se bahar ocean ki taraf jane ka koi rasta nahi, to wo lake hai, chahe naqshay par us ke sath Sea hi kyun na likha ho."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Caspian ko duniya ki sab se bari lake ke tor par pakka kar lo. Sawal seedha ata hai ke Caspian Sea asal me kya hai, aur sahi jawab lake hai. Naam par mat jao, shakal aur rabte par jao."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Island aur Archipelago"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Island yani jazira chaaron taraf pani se ghiri hui zameen hai. Aur jab bohat se jazire aik hi ilaqay me jhund ki surat me phailay hon to us pure jhund ko archipelago kehte hain. Aik jazira akela hota hai, archipelago jaziron ka majmua hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Naqshay par pehchan ye hai. Akela jazira pani ke darmiyan aik alag zameeni nuqta sa nazar ayega. Archipelago me chhoti chhoti zameenain aik silsile ya jhund ki surat me door tak phaili hongi, jese pani par nishan paray hon."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Duniya ki misaal ye hai. Indonesia duniya ka sab se bara archipelago mulk hai jo hazaron jaziron par phaila hai, aur Philippines bhi mashhoor archipelago hai. Maldives chhote jaziron ka archipelago hai. Pakistan ka sab se bara jazira Astola hai aur Karachi ke qareeb Bundal aur Manora ke jazire hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Indonesia ko sab se bara archipelago mulk pakka kar lo. Aur ye bhi ke jazira chaaron taraf pani se ghira hota hai, teen taraf pani ho to wo peninsula hai, jazira nahi. Ye farq pehle bhi aya tha, yahan pakka ho gaya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Coast (Sahil)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Wo kinara jahan zameen khatam aur samandar shuru hota hai, use coast yani sahil kehte hain. Sahil par hi bandargahen banti hain, machhli pakri jati hai, aur lagoon, cape aur bay jaisi tamam shaklain bhi sahil par hi banti hain jin ka zikr is file me aya hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Naqshay par pehchan ye hai. Sahil wo lakeer hai jahan zameen ka rang khatam aur pani ka neela rang shuru hota hai. Jitni lambi ye lakeer kisi mulk ke hisse me aye, utna hi lamba us ka sahil ginna jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Duniya ki misaal ye hai. Duniya ka sab se lamba sahil Canada ka hai, kyunke us ke shumal me hazaron jazire hain aur har jazire ka apna sahil hai. Pakistan ki misaal pakki hai, hamara sahil takreeban 1,046 kilometre lamba hai jo sirf do sobon, Sindh aur Balochistan, ke sath lagta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Pakistan ke sahil ki lambai 1,046 kilometre aur ye ke Punjab aur Khyber Pakhtunkhwa ka koi sahil nahi, ye do baatein paper me dohrayi jati hain. Aur Canada ko sab se lambe sahil ke sath yaad rakho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Reef"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Pani ke andar chattanon ya coral ki bani hui wo lambi patti ya deewar jo satah ke qareeb hoti hai, use reef kehte hain. Coral reef zinda mojoodon ki kaloni se banti hai, chhote chhote coral janwar saalon me aik dusre ke upar ghar banate rehte hain. Reef sirf garam, saaf aur uthle pani me banti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Naqshay par pehchan ye hai. Sahil ya jazire ke gird aik halki si lakeer ya kinara nazar ata hai, aur aksar usi reef ke andar ki taraf lagoon banta hai. Bare naqshon par mashhoor reefs ke naam likhe hote hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Duniya ki misaal ye hai. Australia ki Great Barrier Reef duniya ki sab se bari coral reef hai, takreeban 2,300 kilometre lambi, aur zinda mojoodon ki banayi hui duniya ki sab se bari cheez kahi jati hai. Pakistan me Churna Island aur Astola ke gird chhoti coral reefs payi jati hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Great Barrier Reef ko Australia aur sab se bari reef ke jore ke sath pakka kar lo. Aur ye bhi ke reef jahazon ke liye khatarnaak hoti hai kyunke wo satah ke bilkul qareeb chhupi hoti hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Ocean Trench"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Samandar ki teh me bani hui bohat gehri aur lambi khaai ko ocean trench kehte hain. Ye wahan banti hai jahan samandar ke farsh ki aik bari plate dusri plate ke neeche dhasti hai. Ye khaaiyan samandar ki sab se gehri jagahen hain, zameen ke sab se neeley nuqte."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Naqshay par pehchan ye hai. Ye aksar jaziron ki qataar ke sath sath chalti hui aik gehri lakeer ki surat me dikhti hai, aur bare naqshon par is ka naam wazeh likha hota hai. Aam naqshay par gehrai rang se pata chalti hai, jitna gehra neela utni gehrai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Duniya ki misaal ye hai. Mariana Trench Pacific Ocean me hai aur is ka sab se gehra nuqta Challenger Deep hai jo takreeban gyarah kilometre gehra hai. Is ka andaza yun lagao ke duniya ki sab se unchi choti Mount Everest ko is me dala jaye to us ki choti bhi pani ke neeche rahe gi. Pakistan ke qareeb koi mashhoor trench nahi, hamara samandar nisbatan uthla hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Mariana ko sab se gehri trench aur Pacific Ocean ke sath pakka kar lo. Sab se gehra nuqta wala sawal bar bar ata hai aur us ka jawab hamesha yehi hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Ocean Current"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Samandar ke pani ka aik tay shuda simt me musalsal behne wala wasee bahao ocean current kehlata hai, jese samandar ke andar behta hua aik bara darya. Kuch currents garam ilaaqon ka pani le jati hain, unhe garam current kehte hain, aur kuch thande ilaaqon ka pani lati hain, wo thandi current hoti hain. In ka asar kinare ke mulkon ke mausam par parta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Duniya ki do mashhoor misaalein hi paper ke liye kaafi hain. Gulf Stream garam current hai. Ye Gulf of Mexico ke garam pani se nikal kar Atlantic paar karti hai aur Europe ke maghribi sahilon tak garmi pohanchati hai, yehi wajah hai ke England aur Norway itne shumal me honay ke bawajood sakht barfeelay nahi hote. Labrador Current thandi current hai jo Canada ke mashriqi sahel ke sath thanda pani laati hai. Jahan ye garam Gulf Stream se takrati hai wahan sakht dhund banti hai aur machhliyon ki mashhoor jagah Grand Banks hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Garam aur thandi current ka jora bana kar ata hai. Gulf Stream garam, Labrador thandi. Bas ye jora aur ye baat ke currents kinare ke mausam badal deti hain, itna pakka kar lo."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Tide (Jowar Bhata)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Matlab ye hai. Samandar ke pani ka din me do dafa upar charhna aur do dafa utarna jowar bhata kehlata hai. Charha hua pani jowar hai aur utra hua pani bhata. Is ki sab se bari wajah Chaand ki kashish yani gravity hai. Suraj ka asar bhi hota hai lekin kam, kyunke wo bohat door hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Naqshay par ye shakal ki tarah nahi dikhta, ye waqt ke sath badalne wala amal hai. Is ki pehchan ye hai ke bandargahon par jahazon ki amad aur raft jowar ke auqaat dekh kar tay hoti hai. Karachi ki bandargah par bhi roz jowar bhata hota hai aur jahaz aksar unche pani ke waqt andar ate hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Duniya ki misaal ye hai. Canada ki Bay of Fundy me duniya ka sab se uncha jowar ata hai, pani takreeban solah metre tak upar charh jata hai. Pakistan me itna uncha jowar nahi hota, lekin Karachi aur Gwadar dono par ye amal roz hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali baat ye hai. Wajah wala sawal ata hai. Jowar bhate ki sab se bari wajah Chaand ki kashish hai. Chaand chhota hai lekin qareeb hai, Suraj bara hai lekin door hai, is liye jeet Chaand ki hoti hai. Ye wajah wala jumla pakka kar lo."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Aakhri baat"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab naqshay par koi shakal dekho to pehle us ka naam apne zehen me lo. Pani zameen ke andar ghusa hai to khaleej ya khaari, pani ki tang gali hai to aabnaay, zameen pani me nikli hai to peninsula ya ras. Naam sahi ajaye to sawal aadha wahi hal ho jata hai. Agli file me yehi shaklain asal naam wali jagahon ke sath milengi, duniya ki mashhoor khaleejain, aabnayen aur samandar, har aik apni kahani ke sath."),
    ],
  ),
];
